ence of simple functions satisfying (7), define <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  (8)\\qquad \\int _0^T f(t)\\, dt:=\\lim _{k\\to \\infty }\\int _0^T s_k(t)\\, dt.  \\]\">\\[  (8)\\qquad \\int _0^T f(t)\\, dt:=\\lim _{k\\to \\infty }\\int _0^T s_k(t)\\, dt.  \\]</span> ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:summable-banach-valued-function","next":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#thm:bochner-theorem","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:summable-banach-valued-function","title":"def:summable-banach-valued-function","label":"def:summable-banach-valued-function"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:integral-of-simple-function","title":"def:integral-of-simple-function","label":"def:integral-of-simple-function"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#thm:bochner-theorem","title":"thm:bochner-theorem","label":"thm:bochner-theorem"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:bochner-integral","title":"def:bochner-integral","tex":"\\begin{definition}[Bochner integral]\n\\label{def:bochner-integral}\n\\uses{def:summable-banach-valued-function, def:integral-of-simple-function}\n\\dcref{appE:E.5-def-7}\n\\group{Vector-Valued Integration}\n\nFor a summable $f$ and any sequence of simple functions satisfying (7), define\n\\[\n(8)\\qquad\n\\int_0^T f(t)\\,dt:=\\lim_{k\\to\\infty}\\int_0^T s_k(t)\\,dt.\n\\]\n\\end{definition}","source":"tex/references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:summable-banach-valued-function","title":"def:summable-banach-valued-function","description":""},{"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:integral-of-simple-function